<Layout title="Methodology & limitations"><section class="page-intro"><h1>A clear record.<br />An open question.</h1><p>How to read Zilnon Open, and what its reports can and cannot tell you.</p></section><div class="methodology"><section><h2>What is published here</h2><p>Zilnon Open is a public reading room for company fundamentals, news analysis, and social research. Reports are generated upstream and published as static pages. The public website does not perform analysis on demand.</p><p>The watchlist defines the research focus. It is not a model portfolio or a recommendation to trade. This site has no brokerage connection, visitor-facing language model, or account access.</p></section><section><h2>Read the type of claim</h2><dl class="claim-definitions"><div><dt>Source fact</dt><dd>A statement attributed to cited evidence. Check the original source and its date.</dd></div><div><dt>Source claim</dt><dd>Something a source asserts. Attribution does not establish that the assertion is true.</dd></div><div><dt>Interpretation</dt><dd>The generated report's reading of the evidence, separate from the evidence itself.</dd></div><div><dt>Uncertainty</dt><dd>Information that is missing, disputed, or insufficient to support a conclusion.</dd></div><div><dt>Research question</dt><dd>A question to investigate, not an established outcome.</dd></div><div><dt>Summary</dt><dd>A condensed account. Consult the full discussion and citations for context.</dd></div></dl></section><section><h2>Three clocks, different meanings</h2><p><strong>Evidence as of</strong> is the report's information cutoff. <strong>Generated</strong> records when the report was created. <strong>Published</strong> records when that report was first admitted to the public publication snapshot. The website is built and uploaded to cloud hosting afterward; this timestamp is not an upload receipt.</p><p>All displayed times use Singapore time, SGT (UTC+8). The underlying records retain UTC timestamps. Date-only source publications retain their calendar date and are labeled “Date only”; no time or timezone is inferred. A recent publication time does not imply that the underlying evidence is recent.</p></section><section><h2>Generated means unreviewed</h2><p>Reports carry their review status. A completed generation is not a human endorsement. Generated text can misinterpret sources, omit context, or contain errors. Sources may disagree or change after publication.</p><p>Source links let you check the evidence. Social commentary is treated as attributed claims and research leads, not verified financial fact. No report establishes future performance or removes investment risk.</p></section><section><h2>Demonstration content</h2><p>Synthetic reports are explicitly marked on the site and within each report. They demonstrate the reading experience and citation structure, not actual news, financial results, or current analysis. Example source links provide background only and do not substantiate invented events.</p></section><section><h2>Publication boundaries</h2><p>Only the public report contract is rendered here. Private working notes, credentials, account records, internal diagnostics, and broker data do not belong in that contract. Failed or incomplete reports are not published.</p><p>The website is a reading surface. Any investment decision and any trading activity remain outside it.</p><a href="https://github.com/Zilnon/zilnon-open" rel="noreferrer">Read the source and publication contract ↗</a></section></div></Layout>
